<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    English, the default and the only complete file. Every other values-<code>/strings.xml
    may be partial: Android falls back to this one key by key, so a half-finished
    translation ships safely. How to add a language: android/README-translations.md.

    House rules (docs/design, the launcher design, section 9.3):
      - no key is reused across two screens, even where the English matches;
      - no sentence is assembled from pieces in code: one format string a sentence;
      - every placeholder is positional (%1$s), and its meaning is in a comment above;
      - file names, paths, flag names and INI keys are never translated.
-->
